  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Primary and secondary cities in developing and emerging countries are in a better position to gain access to financing for sustainable climate-related projects that contribute to the global sustainability goals of Agenda 2030 and their countrys NDCs.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Prim&#xe4;r- und Sekund&#xe4;rst&#xe4;dte in Entwicklungs- und Schwellenl&#xe4;ndern sind besser in der Lage, Zugang zu Finanzierung f&#xfc;r nachhaltige klimarelevante Projekte zu erhalten, welche zu den globalen Nachhaltigkeitszielen der Agenda 2030 und  zu den national festgelegten Beitr&#xe4;gen ihres Landes zum Pariser Klimaabkommen beitragen.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Primary and secondary cities in developing and emerging countries are in a better position to gain access to financing for sustainable climate-related projects that contribute to the global sustainability goals of Agenda 2030 and their countrys NDCs.</narrative>
